<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Privacy Policy</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/policy.css">

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="container">
        <h1><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Your privacy is important to us.</p>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="policy-container">

<div class="policy-box">

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
We collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone
number, delivery address, and payment details to provide better services.
</p>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

<ul>
<li>To process your food orders.</li>
<li>To improve customer service.</li>
<li>To send order updates.</li>
<li>To improve website performance.</li>
<li>To provide customer support.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Payment Security</h2>

<p>
Your payment information is processed using secure payment gateways. We do not
store sensitive payment details on our servers.
</p>

<h2>4. Cookies</h2>

<p>
Our website may use cookies to improve user experience and remember your
preferences.
</p>

<h2>5. Data Protection</h2>

<p>
We use reasonable security measures to protect your personal information from
unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.
</p>

<h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
We may use third-party delivery partners and payment gateways to complete your
orders. These providers have their own privacy policies.
</p>

<h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
Our services are not intended for children under 13 years of age.
</p>

<h2>8. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected
on this page.
</p>

<h2>9. Contact</h2>

<p>
If you have any questions regarding our Privacy Policy, feel free to contact
our support team.
</p>

</div>

</section>

</body>
</html>